mable reason, you decide to put them on..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The lenses of these sunglasses are pitch black, and once you put them on, the entire world goes dark."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_AMB_waves_and_seagulls_oneshot","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Splash... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The waves strike the hull of the boat rhythmically. The salty sea air is laced with a barely noticeable tinge of floral fragrance."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Hold on! What is happening?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You try to take off the sunglasses, but your panicked fingers find nothing on your face."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The wheel of fate is turning once more."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What does that mean? Who are you?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Life is a tree, and time flows like water from the crown to each branch. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Don't you want to find out what fruit is borne at the end of each branch?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Stop talking to me in riddles!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It has been set in motion since long ago. It will not stop now."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans